# Citation metadata for carbon-atlas.
# No DOI, no version and no release date are recorded yet. Add them at the first release.
# `license` below is the licence of the CODE. The collected data is under CC BY 4.0 and the
# terms of each publisher. See LICENSE-DATA.md and NOTICE.md.
cff-version: 1.2.0
license: Apache-2.0
message: If you use carbon-atlas, cite it as below.
title: carbon-atlas
type: software
abstract: >-
  A multi-source grid-carbon dataset and a static HTML portal for European countries.
  carbon-atlas collects the carbon intensity of the electricity grid from public
  publishers, keeps every reading with its source, and compares countries, seasons and
  hours. It also measures where the publishers of one country disagree.
authors:
  - name: Wirtek
keywords:
  - carbon intensity
  - electricity grid
  - open data
  - Europe
